As an architect , I design and oversee projects that combine aesthetics, functionality, and sustainability. I collaborate with clients, contractors, and engineers to deliver high-quality solutions that meet the needs and expectations of the end-users and the environment. My passion for architecture stems from my curiosity and appreciation of different cultures and histories. I constantly travel and explore new places, shapes, spaces, and geometries, and draw inspiration from them for my own work. I use the pencil as my simplest and most powerful tool to express my ideas and vision. I aspire to create architecture that reflects and respects the diversity and richness of the world.
