## About

ARPIO is a Casablanca-based architecture firm with a dozen employees, founded in 1995 by Mohamed Berrada and particularly concerned with environmental challenges. For more than 27 years, Arpio Architects has designed some of the most remarkable public and cultural projects in Morocco and elsewhere. Pluralistic and innovative, our work finds its roots in all sectors with finesse and elegance. Hotels, high schools, private clinics or homes, everything we touch receives the same attention and dedication, to build innovative projects suiting the needs of the user, the context and the functional, aesthetical, economical and environmental aspects.

