ux électriques (courants forts et faibles). Nous optimisons les consommations énergétiques et garantissons le confort et la sécurité des occupants.\n * VRD (Voirie et Réseaux Divers) : Conception et dimensionnement des infrastructures de voirie, des réseaux d'assainissement (eaux usées et eaux pluviales), d'adduction d'eau potable, de réseaux secs (électricité, télécommunications, éclairage public).\n*Sécurité Incendie : Études et mise en conformité des systèmes de sécurité incendie (désenfumage, compartimentage, évacuation), accompagnement pour l'obtention des permis de construire et d'exploiter."",""image"":""https://lechantier.ma/uploads/media/bf1552c7181c.webp"",""logo"":""https://lechantier.ma/uploads/media/dbbeee9eae97.webp"",""telephone"":""+212689355667"",""url"":""https://lechantier.ma/pros/profil/global-engineering-entrepreneurship-company"",""address"":{""@type"":""PostalAddress"",""streetAddress"":""Amical el fath rasmouka tiznit"",""addressLocality"":""Tiznit"",""addressCountry"":""MA""},""areaServed"":[{""@type"":""City"",""name"":""Agadir"",""address"":{""@type"":""PostalAddress"",""addressLocality"":""Agadir"",""addressCountry"":""MA""}},{""@type"":""City"",""name"":""Tiznit"",""address"":{""@type"":""PostalAddress"",""addressLocality"":""Tiznit"",""addressCountry"":""MA""}}],""priceRange"":""$$"",""identifier"":{""@type"":""PropertyValue"",""name"":""ICE"",""value"":""002800370000055""}},{""@context"":""https://schema.org"",""@type"":""BreadcrumbList"",""itemListElement"":[{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":1,""name"":""Home"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":2,""name"":""Professionals"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/pros/annuaire""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":3,""name"":""Engineering firm"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/pros/bureau-etudes""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":4,""name"":""Global engineering & entrepreneurship company "",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/pros/pro