PhiCo Manufacturing specializes in the design, fabrication, and installation of glass, aluminium, and metalwork solutions for residential and commercial projects. Based in Casablanca, we provide aluminium windows and doors, shower enclosures, glass railings, interior partitions, mirrors, storefronts, curtain walls, steel structures, and custom architectural metalwork. We offer both standard and fully customized solutions, with particular expertise in technically demanding projects and unique architectural designs. Our services cover site measurements, technical studies, detailed drawings, fabrication, and installation, providing coordinated support from concept to completion. Drawing on experience in Morocco and the United States, we work with homeowners, architects, contractors, and property developers. Whether for an individual installation, a private villa, an office, or a larger development, our focus remains the same: precision, quality finishes, functionality, and attention to detail.",,https://api.apify.com/v2/key-value-stores/DVJaDEI34UpXHJdGU/records/html-47c2e80-phico-manufacturing?signature=CDiPPEmyXV5CEgUDNK3Q,"# PHICO MANUFACTURING — Aluminium in Casablanca

