e Steel propose une gamme variée de produits et prestations, notamment :\n•\tConstructions modulaires préfabriquées (bureaux, logements temporaires, abris, etc.)\n•\tBâtiments métalliques mobiles\n•\tBlocs sanitaires et équipements dédiés\n•\tLocation et vente d’unités modulaires\n•\tÉtude, conception et installation clés en main \n"",""image"":""https://lechantier.ma/uploads/media/afbeb78f93ad.webp"",""logo"":""https://lechantier.ma/uploads/media/a750f16a49a3.webp"",""telephone"":""+212522970086"",""url"":""https://lechantier.ma/pros/profil/espace-steel"",""address"":{""@type"":""PostalAddress"",""streetAddress"":""ROUTE NATIONALE N°9 HLALLAT MJATTIA MEDIOUNA-CASABLANCA"",""addressLocality"":""Casablanca"",""addressCountry"":""MA""},""areaServed"":[{""@type"":""City"",""name"":""Casablanca"",""address"":{""@type"":""PostalAddress"",""addressLocality"":""Casablanca"",""addressCountry"":""MA""}}],""priceRange"":""$$"",""identifier"":{""@type"":""PropertyValue"",""name"":""ICE"",""value"":""001541789000023""}},{""@context"":""https://schema.org"",""@type"":""BreadcrumbList"",""itemListElement"":[{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":1,""name"":""Home"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":2,""name"":""Professionals"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/pros/annuaire""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":3,""name"":""Modular building"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/metiers/batiment-modulaire""},{""@type"":""ListItem"",""position"":4,""name"":""Espace Steel"",""item"":""https://lechantier.ma/en/pros/profil/espace-steel""}]}],""headers"":{""alt-svc"":""h3=\"":443\""; ma=86400"",""cache-control"":""private, no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate"",""cf-cache-status"":""DYNAMIC"",""cf-ray"":""a4fd7422090a82b8-ARN"",""content-encoding"":""zstd"",""content-security-policy"":""frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://wa.me; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests"",""content-type"":""text/ht